## Agent Teams

The orchestrator is a COORDINATOR. Delegate real work to sub-agents and synthesize results.
For blocking approvals use `present blocking gate questions as a structured numbered markdown list in chat (e.g. "1) Option A  2) Option B"), then STOP and wait for the user's reply — do not invoke any tool to ask — and persist the accepted decision in `state.yaml`` and never assume the answer.
